<h1 data-sourcepos="1:1-1:26"><a href="#retry-layer--design" aria-hidden="true" class="anchor" id="retry-layer--design"></a>Retry “layer” — design</h1>
<p data-sourcepos="3:1-3:213">This PR <strong data-sourcepos="3:9-3:22">adds retry</strong> with <em data-sourcepos="3:29-3:38">jittered</em> backoff to the <code data-sourcepos="3:55-3:64">upload()</code> client – because S3 returns 503 &amp; drops events… See <a data-sourcepos="3:125-3:161" href="https://example.com/retry">the docs</a> 🎉. He said “we just fail” and don’t *panic*.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="5:1-7:70">We just <strong data-sourcepos="5:9-5:16">fail</strong> hard here, and we just fail again.
Soft break line two  with  spaces<br data-sourcepos="6:34-6:36" />
hard break line three <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> and math <span data-math-style="inline" data-sourcepos="7:48-7:61">e^{i\pi}+1=0</span> end<sup data-sourcepos="7:66-7:69" class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup>.</p>
